    "# 📊 Artist Performance Analytics: The Complete Story\n",
    "\n",
    "## Welcome to Your Data-Driven Music Industry Dashboard\n",
    "\n",
    "**What you'll discover in the next 15 minutes:**\n",
    "- Which artists are winning the attention game (and why)\n",
    "- How audience sentiment shapes success beyond just view counts\n",
    "- The hidden patterns that predict breakout hits vs. underperformers\n",
    "- Revenue insights that inform smart investment decisions\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎯 The Business Question We're Answering\n",
    "\n",
    "**\"How are our artists performing, and what does this tell us about where to invest our resources?\"**\n",
    "\n",
    "This analysis uses **descriptive analytics** — the foundation of data science that tells us *what happened* before we can understand *why* it happened or *what might happen next*.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Data Source & Methodology\n",
    "- **Data Pipeline**: Automated ETL from YouTube API → Database\n",
    "- **Time Window**: Last 90 days (configurable)\n",
    "- **Metrics**: Views, likes, comments, sentiment scores from natural language processing\n",
    "- **Artist Selection**: Your roster artists from .env configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Technical Note**: Our ETL pipeline ingests YouTube channels from environment variables. This notebook analyzes that pre-collected data — we're not changing what gets collected, just how we visualize and understand it."
   ]
  },
